WEBVTT

00:06:28.423 --> 00:06:30.863
and more people joined the fray,

00:06:30.887 --> 00:06:33.523
asking for the loophole
in the law to be closed.

00:06:34.094 --> 00:06:38.657
And then in October 2016,
after months of campaigning,

00:06:38.681 --> 00:06:40.833
the loophole was indeed closed.

00:06:41.181 --> 00:06:45.463
(Applause)

00:06:45.487 --> 00:06:48.960
And now men who kill women
in the name of honor

00:06:48.984 --> 00:06:51.308
receive life imprisonment.

00:06:51.986 --> 00:06:56.703
(Applause)

00:06:56.727 --> 00:06:59.283
Yet, the very next day,

00:06:59.307 --> 00:07:01.639
a woman was killed in the name of honor,